## Source and implementation standing

The one new commission source identifies the September 10 authorial conversation and its three retained inputs. It is provenance of thinking, never external evidence; it has no quotation/citation-readiness pretence. The September Scientific pair is Prompts/Traces/Challenges/Patterns/Discovery/Insight. The June Observe–Verify sequence remains dated source material. Both full Name/Power constellations and the difference between same-index and complementary-index pairing remain in C39.

The O:I source and responsibility dossier retain the exact September 8 constructor checks and their limited execution evidence. This batch does not claim a current product deployment, empirical efficacy of the lenses or a phenomenal subject for a model. New comparisons are Offered; product philosophy remains Argued. Exact Sanskrit/edition and Abhinavagupta interval collation remains the targeted R1 source debt. No protected notebook or authorial manuscript is altered.

