36 A + 36 A′ + 64 C + A/C + S + S0–S5 = **144 actual shared records**. The products index is not counted. The whole publication and source censuses are separately computed by the native tools. The all-lens reusable CSV overlay is a separately retained follow-on after S semantics settle; it is not required to replace these twelve-term paired developments.

R3 still must independently recover and refine the complete 144-record field through the four registers and every whole relation it actually consumes. R4 still must review all eight stations/48 movements and their register/prose allocations. Transport fidelity and product count cannot stand in for either semantic review.

